{#-
  The landing page of a document doc-class (Stage 6c, design.md section 10.5).

  **Frontmatter included**, unlike `index.md.j2`. That one is body-only because
  the converter's `_render` heads every page it writes; nothing converts a folder
  of PDFs, so this template is the only place the frontmatter can come from. The
  keys are the `online-help` index's plus `doc_class`.

  `entry.link` is the percent-encoded filename, not `entry.name`: the corpus ships
  `mft platform server v7.1 for windows release notes.pdf`, and a Markdown link
  target stops at the first space in every renderer.
-#}
---
title: {{ title | yaml }}
doc_class: {{ doc_class | yaml }}
generated: true
---

# {{ title }}

{% for entry in entries -%}
- [{{ entry.title }}]({{ entry.link }})
{% endfor -%}
